    "detailed_description": "<h1>SteamDeck: Ultra High Frame Rate, Supports Steam Workshop</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/966098c274e5ecb519f628279f254f21.avif?t=1755375944\" data-has-big width=800 height=362 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>\u3010Peachy Girl's Adventure\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story of girl Natsuki joining the &quot;Ninja Racing Tournament&quot; with her friends to pay off her debt. A total of 16 chapters. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/994516d51063464f1b3b51ddf4d5419f.poster.avif?t=1755375944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/994516d51063464f1b3b51ddf4d5419f.webm?t=1755375944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/994516d51063464f1b3b51ddf4d5419f.mp4?t=1755375944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Humanoid Kart Racing\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a girl and reach the finish line before the others</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/0fb227a9cd34fa08b5e5a0c8ec55f8d4.poster.avif?t=1755375944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/0fb227a9cd34fa08b5e5a0c8ec55f8d4.webm?t=1755375944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049580/extras/0fb227a9cd34fa08b5e